    "name": "Stuck In The Backrooms",
    "steam_appid": 3523630,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523630/extras/ffa759356463050dd8737f4165292c13.avif?t=1754199002\" width=1080 height=175 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stuck in the Backrooms</i> is a co-op psychological horror game that follows the popular creepypasta lore of the Backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an explorer from a secret group dedicated to investigating the Backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an unexpected no-clip during a mission, you're separated from your team and dropped into a <strong>different Backrooms reality.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the levels that you encounter are already explored by the backrooms exploration groups and from a guy named Noah, while others don't have a single sign of human presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523630/extras/c698e779f7626847e254ef3846dc5a7f.avif?t=1754199002\" width=1080 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work alone or with up to 3 teammates. Everyone must reach the exit to escape \u2014 no one gets left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523630/extras/c13e8ecf213609098691097a3202f49b.avif?t=1754199002\" width=1080 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level introduces new mechanics, escape conditions, and puzzles \u2014 including logic-based tasks, hidden clues, and audio-based codes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523630/extras/83cd6a9d2f33c613b056e266fe693d64.avif?t=1754199002\" width=1080 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the remnants of those who came before \u2014 including Noah, an ordinary office worker who left behind notes, hints, and warnings. Eventually, the trail runs cold\u2026 and you're completely alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523630/extras/3ccd4b76bbde1c82438741b627a7855b.avif?t=1754199002\" width=1080 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From flooded server rooms to haunting office zones that echo real memories, each level shifts in tone, atmosphere, and danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523630/extras/94b3bd3d2b45f92e2f266afdf3b68851.avif?t=1754199002\" width=1080 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every creature behaves differently. Learn their mechanics fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523630/extras/5684fc58a0a090fe574162f77259c43f.avif?t=1754199002\" width=1080 height=175 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health: Do not risk your life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamina: Only sprint if necessary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity: Always keep attention on your sanity as it may kill you without you even knowing it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notes: They guide you and tell you information about past events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory: Drop, keep or use your items.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523630/extras/a36e514094acdce0c2a7398a6d36d994.avif?t=1754199002\" width=1080 height=175 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almond Water: Restores some health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Syringe: Makes you run faster without getting tired for 15 seconds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pill: Regenerates some sanity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523630/extras/65787b7278a3739b6dd252cf68062288.avif?t=1754199002\" width=1080 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay close and coordinate. Sound attracts attention, and speaking too loud could cost you everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523630/extras/1abb4bea1bca092362470e17b5fe5a41.avif?t=1754199002\" width=1080 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made in Unreal Engine 5 with minimal UI and immersive visual design to pull you fully into the Backrooms.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523630/extras/ffa759356463050dd8737f4165292c13.avif?t=1754199002\" width=1080 height=175 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Stuck in the Backrooms</i> is a co-op psychological horror game that follows the popular creepypasta lore of the Backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an explorer from a secret group dedicated to investigating the Backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After an unexpected no-clip during a mission, you're separated from your team and dropped into a <strong>different Backrooms reality.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the levels that you encounter are already explored by the backrooms exploration groups and from a guy named Noah, while others don't have a single sign of human presence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523630/extras/c698e779f7626847e254ef3846dc5a7f.avif?t=1754199002\" width=1080 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work alone or with up to 3 teammates. Everyone must reach the exit to escape \u2014 no one gets left behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523630/extras/c13e8ecf213609098691097a3202f49b.avif?t=1754199002\" width=1080 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level introduces new mechanics, escape conditions, and puzzles \u2014 including logic-based tasks, hidden clues, and audio-based codes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523630/extras/83cd6a9d2f33c613b056e266fe693d64.avif?t=1754199002\" width=1080 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the remnants of those who came before \u2014 including Noah, an ordinary office worker who left behind notes, hints, and warnings. Eventually, the trail runs cold\u2026 and you're completely alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523630/extras/3ccd4b76bbde1c82438741b627a7855b.avif?t=1754199002\" width=1080 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From flooded server rooms to haunting office zones that echo real memories, each level shifts in tone, atmosphere, and danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523630/extras/94b3bd3d2b45f92e2f266afdf3b68851.avif?t=1754199002\" width=1080 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every creature behaves differently. Learn their mechanics fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523630/extras/5684fc58a0a090fe574162f77259c43f.avif?t=1754199002\" width=1080 height=175 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health: Do not risk your life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamina: Only sprint if necessary.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity: Always keep attention on your sanity as it may kill you without you even knowing it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notes: They guide you and tell you information about past events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory: Drop, keep or use your items.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523630/extras/a36e514094acdce0c2a7398a6d36d994.avif?t=1754199002\" width=1080 height=175 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almond Water: Restores some health.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Syringe: Makes you run faster without getting tired for 15 seconds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pill: Regenerates some sanity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523630/extras/65787b7278a3739b6dd252cf68062288.avif?t=1754199002\" width=1080 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay close and coordinate. Sound attracts attention, and speaking too loud could cost you everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523630/extras/1abb4bea1bca092362470e17b5fe5a41.avif?t=1754199002\" width=1080 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made in Unreal Engine 5 with minimal UI and immersive visual design to pull you fully into the Backrooms.</p>",
